INT. SUB-OCEANIC DRILLING RIG - CORRIDOR - NIGHT
[SCORE: Horror Ambient | SFX: Creepy Ambience, Water Dripping]

Emergency yellow strobe lights rotate slowly along the flooded catwalk. Deep sub-oceanic pressure groans through reinforced bulkheads.

DR. ABE REID (50s, diving pressure suit) wades through knee-deep seawater carrying an acoustic sensor.

[SFX: Sonar Ping - High Resonant Echo]

ABE
